Package: wilcoxon
Type: Package
Title: Wilcoxon Tests and Hodges-Lehmann Estimation for the One- and
    Two-Sample Location Problems
Version: 0.0.5
Date: 2026-09-05
Author: John Kloke, Joseph McKean
Maintainer: John Kloke <johndkloke@gmail.com>
Description: Wilcoxon signed-rank and rank-sum inference for the one- and
    two-sample location problems, with Hodges-Lehmann point estimates and
    distribution-free confidence intervals.  The main driver, wilcoxon_test,
    provides an htest-compatible interface; the confidence interval and point
    estimate use validated implementations that avoid the off-by-one indexing
    of stats::wilcox.test.  Multiple algorithms are available for the
    confidence interval: direct construction, root-finding via uniroot, and
    (two-sample only) an R port of the Illinois-modified regula falsi
    algorithm of Ryan and McKean (1977, TOMS Algorithm 516).
License: GPL (>= 2)
Imports: stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
